[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0010","text":"果穗的荧光笔好可爱～！\n快看凛世酱！　柴犬图案……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0020","text":"呵呵……\n真是……非常可爱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0030","text":"说起来，我上学的时候\n也有很多人有各种文具呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0040","text":"！！\n大家都有柴犬图案的笔吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0003","text":"好像是\n带亮片的笔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0004","text":"我见过\n香味橡皮擦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_00_0005","text":"好像还\n换过贴纸……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_01_0010","text":"带亮片的……笔……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_01_0020","text":"闪闪发光的超厉害的那种！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_02_0010","text":"啊～！　有的有的！\n有水果味的，还有巧克力味的——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_02_0020","text":"嘿嘿\n肚子都饿了……呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_03_0010","text":"贴纸的话……\n果穗有……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03010000_03_0020","text":"嗯！\n我有好多呢——！"}]
